			M4A1MarkDetonation.DisplayName: 战术爆破
			M4A1LockOnBox.DisplayName: 锁定框
			M4A1UltimateShell.DisplayName: 复仇炮弹
			M4A1SyncBarProjectile.DisplayName: 战术同步率
